{"id":"steam-1030740","steam":1030740,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Salt the Earth","summary":"Salt the Earth is a multi-unit arena-brawler designed only for online competitive players.","about":"Salt the Earth is an RTS. Well... not really. Salt the Earth is an RTS that focuses entirely on combat, unit control and strategy.\r\n\r\n\n\r\n•  No resource gathering or buildings to construct.\r\n•  Only multiplayer, player-vs-player combat.\r\n•  Focus on competitive gameplay and ladder progression.\r\n•  No skins or in-app purchases.\r\n•  Fantasy based setting.\r\n•  Players vote to balance the game.\r\n\n\r\n    \r\n\r\nSalt the Earth already features 5 playable races, 49 unique units, and over 160 unit abilities. We have plans to add many more races, units, and abilities in the immediate future.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/portrait.png?t=1600887105","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/header.jpg?t=1600887105","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1600887105","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/header.jpg?t=1600887105","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1600887105","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/ss_34865c7fc27dc667f0e9c99f340735246301c1a8.600x338.jpg?t=1600887105","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/ss_34865c7fc27dc667f0e9c99f340735246301c1a8.jpg?t=1600887105"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/ss_20405e12fbd96d8367f9d421b9e5a115408ce7b9.600x338.jpg?t=1600887105","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1030740/ss_20405e12fbd96d8367f9d421b9e5a115408ce7